<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>第二根连杆的角度，是相对谁的？</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CFE0F5' }}>M3 · 驱动问题</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 500, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8EFF8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <svg width={470} height={400} viewBox='0 0 470 400'>
                <line x1='50' y1='300' x2='450' y2='300' stroke='#3D7BD9' strokeWidth='2' />
                <line x1='80' y1='340' x2='80' y2='30' stroke='#3D7BD9' strokeWidth='2' />
                <line x1='80' y1='300' x2='261.3' y2='215.5' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='7' strokeLinecap='round' />
                <line x1='261.3' y1='215.5' x2='316.0' y2='65.1' stroke='#0E3F8C' strokeWidth='7' strokeLinecap='round' />
                <line x1='261.3' y1='215.5' x2='361.0' y2='169.0' stroke='#8FB6E8' strokeWidth='2' strokeDasharray='6 5' />
                <path d='M 140 300 A 60 60 0 0 0 134.4 274.6' fill='none' stroke='#0E3F8C' strokeWidth='2.5' />
                <path d='M 311.2 192.3 A 55 55 0 0 0 280.1 163.8' fill='none' stroke='#D9534F' strokeWidth='2.5' />
                <circle cx='80' cy='300' r='8' fill='#1E4FA8' />
                <circle cx='261.3' cy='215.5' r='8' fill='#1E4FA8' />
                <circle cx='316.0' cy='65.1' r='9' fill='#0E3F8C' />
                <text x='146' y='292' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='18' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>θ₁</text>
                <text x='318' y='186' fill='#D9534F' fontSize='18' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>θ₂</text>
                <text x='158' y='250' fill='#1E4FA8' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>L₁</text>
                <text x='296' y='146' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>L₂</text>
                <text x='328' y='58' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='15' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>末端 (x, y)</text>
                <text x='90' y='286' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='14' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.6'>关节 1</text>
                <text x='200' y='212' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='14' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.6'>关节 2</text>
                <text x='440' y='306' fill='#3D7BD9' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>x</text>
                <text x='86' y='30' fill='#3D7BD9' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>y</text>
                <text x='235' y='382' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='14' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.6'>虚线 = 第一根连杆的延长线，θ₂ 就从这里量起</text>
            </svg>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8EFF8', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.35, fontFamily: 'Times New Roman' }}>A</Text>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>θ₂ 是相对地面的（相对 x 轴）</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.65, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>这样定义“每个关节各管各的，互不影响”。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: 'Times New Roman' }}>B</Text>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>θ₂ 是相对第一根连杆的</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.72, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>第二根要“叠加”在第一根已经转过的角度上。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0E3F8C', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>判断：答案是 B —— 相对角度</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CFE0F5', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>第二个关节的电机就装在第一根连杆的末端上，它转动时坐标系已经跟着转过了。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: 'Times New Roman' }}>所以第二根连杆的绝对方向 = θ₁ + θ₂</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 44, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.5 }}>第 3 章 · M3　平面正运动学：1R → 2R → 3R</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: 'Times New Roman' }}>14 / 21</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
